1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:45,791
The Red Chief.

3
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:47,500
That's the Red Chief!

4
00:00:47,916 --> 00:00:48,875
What did you say?

5
00:00:49,625 --> 00:00:50,708
Ten years ago,

6
00:00:51,291 --> 00:00:53,166
he was the one who won us

7
00:00:53,166 --> 00:00:55,083
a place to settle in the Undercity.

8
00:00:55,666 --> 00:00:56,833
I've heard of him.

9
00:00:58,208 --> 00:00:59,958
But he was a great hero.

10
00:01:00,458 --> 00:01:02,166
How did he end up like this?

11
00:01:02,958 --> 00:01:04,416
Because he lost.

12
00:01:04,916 --> 00:01:07,791
He lost to the strongest Heavenwright
of that era.

13
00:01:08,916 --> 00:01:10,291
I think that person's name was

14
00:01:11,708 --> 00:01:12,708
Le Wei.

15
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,375
(My name is Le Wei.)

16
00:01:16,541 --> 00:01:18,666
(I once bore the "Wei"
of General Weiwu.)

17
00:01:19,291 --> 00:01:20,458
(After leaving the Capital,)

18
00:01:20,791 --> 00:01:23,000
(I became a wild fern
in the Monster Wastes.)

19
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,375
(General Le Wei's Residence)

20
00:01:24,375 --> 00:01:26,375
(Ten years later,
I return to this place)

21
00:01:26,916 --> 00:01:28,541
(only for a promise I made.)

22
00:01:28,541 --> 00:01:32,000
(Just a Little Hardship Along the Way)

23
00:01:37,291 --> 00:01:38,541
The Ascension Trial is not over.

24
00:01:38,916 --> 00:01:40,166
No one can leave the city.

25
00:01:40,791 --> 00:01:43,166
We only want to bury our friend first.

26
00:01:43,666 --> 00:01:45,208
It's a half-monster.

27
00:01:45,708 --> 00:01:47,666
Its bones and fur look pretty good.

28
00:01:47,833 --> 00:01:49,083
Name your price.

29
00:01:49,208 --> 00:01:52,041
We'll sell it to the kiln and turn
it into a Porcelain Armored Beast.

30
00:01:53,083 --> 00:01:53,916
I said,

31
00:01:54,458 --> 00:01:55,958
he's our friend.

32
00:01:56,291 --> 00:01:57,166
Open the gate.

33
00:01:57,416 --> 00:01:58,458
The Middle City has its laws.

34
00:01:58,958 --> 00:02:00,416
Those who force their way
through the gate

35
00:02:01,208 --> 00:02:01,916
die.

36
00:02:05,291 --> 00:02:06,125
You...

37
00:02:07,041 --> 00:02:09,250
The moment you said those words,

38
00:02:09,916 --> 00:02:11,583
you should've died.

39
00:02:16,916 --> 00:02:17,833
Hey.

40
00:02:22,208 --> 00:02:23,666
Come with me.

41
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,958
(Le Residence)

42
00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,333
If Duo Mu knew you were safe,

43
00:02:37,458 --> 00:02:39,041
he'd be so happy.

44
00:02:43,333 --> 00:02:45,083
When he first came here,

45
00:02:46,041 --> 00:02:47,416
he was very withdrawn.

46
00:02:47,875 --> 00:02:49,250
He barely spoke.

47
00:02:50,333 --> 00:02:52,083
Until I brought you back.

48
00:02:52,791 --> 00:02:55,041
You were even quieter than him.

49
00:02:57,208 --> 00:02:58,375
He said

50
00:02:59,750 --> 00:03:01,333
you reminded him of his sister.

51
00:03:02,708 --> 00:03:06,375
After coming here, he only wanted
to do one thing.

52
00:03:07,541 --> 00:03:08,833
To take good care of you.

53
00:03:16,708 --> 00:03:18,708
I want to take him home tomorrow.

54
00:03:19,791 --> 00:03:20,875
What about you?

55
00:03:26,541 --> 00:03:27,916
This second round

56
00:03:28,250 --> 00:03:30,166
was bought with Duo Mu's life.

57
00:03:30,666 --> 00:03:32,166
I have to keep fighting.

58
00:03:33,166 --> 00:03:35,291
Duo Mu never thought of giving up.

59
00:03:35,791 --> 00:03:36,916
Neither will I.

60
00:03:42,416 --> 00:03:43,333
The Middle City Trial

61
00:03:44,041 --> 00:03:45,958
(Redtail)
was prepared specifically for you.

62
00:03:46,916 --> 00:03:48,833
The Defender fights with hammer
and shield as one.

63
00:03:48,958 --> 00:03:50,166
Perfect for both offense and defense.

64
00:03:50,583 --> 00:03:52,541
It's almost impossible
to find an opening head-on.

65
00:03:53,541 --> 00:03:54,375
Unless

66
00:03:55,291 --> 00:03:56,791
you can break his move.

67
00:03:59,916 --> 00:04:01,541
The white-haired guy is dead.

68
00:04:01,833 --> 00:04:03,791
Defender is the Red Chief Chi.

69
00:04:04,791 --> 00:04:06,208
A hero fighting a hero...

70
00:04:06,916 --> 00:04:08,416
Either way, everyone loses.

71
00:04:09,375 --> 00:04:10,875
They've all left.

72
00:04:11,333 --> 00:04:12,458
Aren't you leaving?

73
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:16,291
Someone has to stay.

74
00:04:21,875 --> 00:04:23,333
(The Middle City Arena's)

75
00:04:23,583 --> 00:04:24,916
(second round.)

76
00:04:25,541 --> 00:04:27,875
(Incense lit. Begin!)

77
00:05:04,458 --> 00:05:05,541
(Zhujian and Jiao)

78
00:05:05,791 --> 00:05:07,416
(were born in the miasma marshes.)

79
00:05:07,791 --> 00:05:08,791
(They cannot see through the miasma,)

80
00:05:09,208 --> 00:05:10,625
(and do not rely on sight.)

81
00:05:10,958 --> 00:05:12,458
(They track enemies by heat signatures.)

82
00:05:12,958 --> 00:05:14,125
(Unable to determine direction,)

83
00:05:14,958 --> 00:05:16,291
(they can be attacked from the flank)

84
00:05:16,458 --> 00:05:17,791
(and avoid their strongest attacks.)

85
00:05:20,416 --> 00:05:21,125
My lord.

86
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:22,583
She's changed her strategy.

87
00:05:23,666 --> 00:05:24,916
She's buying time.

88
00:05:25,583 --> 00:05:26,791
She's not wasting attacks,

89
00:05:26,791 --> 00:05:27,916
but only keeping them occupied.

90
00:05:28,333 --> 00:05:29,916
She's waiting for the battle
at the summit to end.

91
00:05:48,041 --> 00:05:49,541
Even if she's only holding them off,

92
00:05:49,833 --> 00:05:51,791
human strength has its limits.

93
00:05:52,583 --> 00:05:55,291
The one wearing him down isn't
the Porcelain Armored Beasts,

94
00:05:55,458 --> 00:05:58,166
but the Porcelain-Control Formation

95
00:05:58,166 --> 00:06:01,166
surrounding the gods in the Yuyou Kiln.

96
00:06:08,291 --> 00:06:10,291
(When he combines his shield
and hammer attacks,)

97
00:06:10,916 --> 00:06:13,583
(his opponent cannot break
through him head-on.)

98
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,583
(But this move allows you
to get behind him.)

99
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:21,666
(Blood Swallow's Return!)

100
00:06:45,416 --> 00:06:48,416
(Your opponent tomorrow
is an old friend of mine.)

101
00:06:49,666 --> 00:06:50,666
(Ten years ago,)

102
00:06:50,666 --> 00:06:53,166
(we promised to meet again within
his spiritual consciousness.)

103
00:06:53,916 --> 00:06:55,791
(Unfortunately, you met him
before I did.)

104
00:06:56,666 --> 00:06:58,208
(Tomorrow will be a fight to the death.)

105
00:06:58,666 --> 00:06:59,666
(So please,)

106
00:07:00,083 --> 00:07:02,541
(fight in my place
and fulfill our promise.)

107
00:07:02,833 --> 00:07:03,833
Who are you?

108
00:07:04,916 --> 00:07:06,125
Who taught you

109
00:07:06,416 --> 00:07:07,666
Blood Swallow's Return?

110
00:07:08,541 --> 00:07:09,666
I am Lu Yuanqing.

111
00:07:10,291 --> 00:07:11,166
This move

112
00:07:11,791 --> 00:07:13,833
was taught to me by General Le Wei.

113
00:07:13,933 --> 00:07:16,508
(Chiming)

114
00:07:19,291 --> 00:07:21,166
What year is it outside?

115
00:07:21,541 --> 00:07:23,291
The 39th year of the Lunisolar Calendar.

116
00:07:24,541 --> 00:07:25,666
Ten years.

117
00:07:26,333 --> 00:07:28,416
I've waited here for ten years.

118
00:07:29,041 --> 00:07:30,666
You finally came.

119
00:07:31,666 --> 00:07:33,541
What are you waiting for?

120
00:07:34,916 --> 00:07:36,916
A promise I made with her.

121
00:07:41,166 --> 00:07:42,000
Ten years ago,

122
00:07:42,333 --> 00:07:43,541
during the Jiazi Uprising,

123
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,791
the Capital seized all
the half-monsters' food.

124
00:07:47,583 --> 00:07:48,583
To survive,

125
00:07:49,041 --> 00:07:50,666
I led my brothers into the city.

126
00:07:51,125 --> 00:07:52,166
The one guarding the city

127
00:07:52,166 --> 00:07:54,166
was General Le Wei.

128
00:08:51,416 --> 00:08:52,666
You can't fly,

129
00:08:52,708 --> 00:08:53,916
yet you still followed me down here?

130
00:08:53,958 --> 00:08:55,166
You kept throwing attacks my way

131
00:08:55,541 --> 00:08:57,291
so I'd have something
to push off from in midair.

132
00:08:57,291 --> 00:08:58,416
You were afraid I'd fall to my death,
weren't you?

133
00:08:59,250 --> 00:09:01,791
My life was bought with the heartblood
of half-monsters.

134
00:09:02,625 --> 00:09:04,625
I owe your kind a life.

135
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:08,000
Consider this repayment.

136
00:09:10,875 --> 00:09:13,291
You're talking about the plague
in the Capital ten years ago.

137
00:09:13,541 --> 00:09:15,625
Countless half-monsters had their hearts
carved out to make medicine.

138
00:09:16,791 --> 00:09:18,208
My brother was one of them.

139
00:09:45,541 --> 00:09:46,250
I never got to choose

140
00:09:46,625 --> 00:09:47,625
the life I was given.

141
00:09:47,708 --> 00:09:50,000
We've endured and endured,

142
00:09:50,166 --> 00:09:51,041
but now,

143
00:09:51,083 --> 00:09:52,083
fighting back

144
00:09:52,333 --> 00:09:54,333
is our only way to survive.

145
00:10:14,083 --> 00:10:14,833
You

146
00:10:15,708 --> 00:10:17,083
can't win.

147
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:19,083
I was one move away.

148
00:10:22,958 --> 00:10:24,375
Even if you defeat me,

149
00:10:24,666 --> 00:10:27,583
you still can't defeat the Porcelain-
Control Formation in the Yuyou Kiln.

150
00:10:27,958 --> 00:10:30,791
The Porcelain Armored Soldiers forged
there are controlled entirely by runes.

151
00:10:30,958 --> 00:10:31,916
They have no consciousness,

152
00:10:32,458 --> 00:10:33,583
no fear,

153
00:10:33,791 --> 00:10:36,083
and exist only to obey the gods.

154
00:10:36,083 --> 00:10:37,541
Nothing but ruthless killing puppets.

155
00:10:38,791 --> 00:10:39,666
So,

156
00:10:40,541 --> 00:10:43,041
if we destroy the Porcelain-Control
Formation in the Yuyou Kiln,

157
00:10:43,541 --> 00:10:46,166
all the Porcelain Armored Soldiers
will shut down, right?

158
00:10:48,291 --> 00:10:50,416
The Porcelain-Control Formation
was created by the gods themselves.

159
00:10:50,916 --> 00:10:52,666
No one knows where its core is.

160
00:10:52,833 --> 00:10:54,083
There's no way to destroy it.

161
00:10:54,791 --> 00:10:57,458
Those Soldiers were forged
through secret runic arts.

162
00:10:58,041 --> 00:10:59,166
They should be able to perceive

163
00:10:59,166 --> 00:11:01,000
the entire formation as it operates,

164
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,291
including the location of its core.

165
00:11:03,666 --> 00:11:05,291
But they have no consciousness.

166
00:11:05,291 --> 00:11:06,041
They...

167
00:11:12,666 --> 00:11:14,541
I'm your prisoner now.

168
00:11:14,708 --> 00:11:15,666
What happens to me

169
00:11:16,333 --> 00:11:18,166
is entirely up to you, General.

170
00:11:19,791 --> 00:11:20,958
What are you going to do?

171
00:11:23,541 --> 00:11:24,083
You

172
00:11:24,541 --> 00:11:25,500
take me

173
00:11:26,791 --> 00:11:28,583
to the Yuyou Kiln.

174
00:11:38,416 --> 00:11:41,083
If one day I become
a merciless killing puppet,

175
00:11:41,583 --> 00:11:42,416
I hope...

176
00:11:46,291 --> 00:11:47,916
you will be the one to cut off my head.

177
00:12:05,416 --> 00:12:08,416
Using her Breath-Suppressing Pill,
I was sent into the kiln.

178
00:12:08,416 --> 00:12:10,083
During the refining process,

179
00:12:10,083 --> 00:12:12,541
I could see how the runes operated

180
00:12:12,791 --> 00:12:14,541
and locate the formation core.

181
00:12:15,416 --> 00:12:16,416
We made a pact.

182
00:12:16,541 --> 00:12:17,666
To strike from within and without,

183
00:12:17,833 --> 00:12:19,083
and break the formation.

184
00:12:19,666 --> 00:12:20,458
Unfortunately,

185
00:12:20,958 --> 00:12:22,833
I underestimated the power of the kiln.

186
00:12:23,666 --> 00:12:24,666
In the end,

187
00:12:26,041 --> 00:12:29,458
all I could preserve was this final
remnant of my spiritual consciousness.

188
00:12:30,916 --> 00:12:31,666
Senior,

189
00:12:32,416 --> 00:12:33,916
so for these ten years,

190
00:12:35,291 --> 00:12:36,958
this fragment of your soul

191
00:12:37,958 --> 00:12:40,666
has endured the agony
of the kiln fire every day.

192
00:12:44,208 --> 00:12:45,250
It was merely

193
00:12:45,666 --> 00:12:47,541
a little hardship along the way.

194
00:12:50,333 --> 00:12:52,291
The formation core is between
the brows of the god statue.

195
00:12:52,291 --> 00:12:54,208
The runes I left on your blade

196
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,666
contain the path leading
to the god statue.

197
00:12:57,041 --> 00:12:58,416
Find the god statue,

198
00:12:58,791 --> 00:13:00,333
and you can break the formation.

199
00:13:03,583 --> 00:13:04,416
Young man,

200
00:13:05,041 --> 00:13:06,833
my battle is over.

201
00:13:07,416 --> 00:13:08,458
The rest

202
00:13:09,083 --> 00:13:10,125
is yours.

203
00:13:13,375 --> 00:13:14,166
Remember,

204
00:13:14,875 --> 00:13:16,250
my name is Chiming.

205
00:13:16,791 --> 00:13:18,041
It means blood-red name.

206
00:13:24,916 --> 00:13:27,083
Turbid Dragon. Third Strike.

207
00:13:29,041 --> 00:13:30,583
Yishui's Cold Wind.

208
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:34,042
(Yishui's Cold Wind)

209
00:13:58,375 --> 00:13:59,583
I, Lu Yuanqing...

210
00:14:00,458 --> 00:14:01,625
With deepest respect, Senior...

211
00:14:02,333 --> 00:14:03,208
Rest in peace!

212
00:14:04,666 --> 00:14:06,125
Rest in peace!

213
00:14:07,791 --> 00:14:09,916
Rest in peace!

214
00:14:12,666 --> 00:14:13,708
Convict Chiming,

215
00:14:13,916 --> 00:14:14,958
for defying the heavens
and causing rebellion,

216
00:14:15,166 --> 00:14:17,208
send him to the Yuyou Porcelain Kiln
at once.

217
00:14:17,458 --> 00:14:18,750
Destroy his monster body,

218
00:14:19,041 --> 00:14:20,041
strip away his life,

219
00:14:20,208 --> 00:14:21,416
and make him a Heavenly Slave forever!

220
00:14:26,750 --> 00:14:27,666
My life

221
00:14:28,291 --> 00:14:30,333
belongs only to General Le Wei.

222
00:14:58,916 --> 00:15:01,416
It is a masterpiece fired for ten years.

223
00:15:02,166 --> 00:15:05,541
How could it be the same as those
ordinary Porcelain Armored Soldiers?

224
00:15:32,042 --> 00:15:34,542
♪Days flow on♪

225
00:15:35,650 --> 00:15:38,242
♪Countless days♪

226
00:15:39,083 --> 00:15:42,242
♪My countless hands♪

227
00:15:43,958 --> 00:15:45,590
♪Reaching out again and again♪

228
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:48,750
♪What do I hold♪

229
00:15:50,250 --> 00:15:53,000
♪Only to drift back here♪

230
00:15:53,625 --> 00:15:56,750
♪You speak without a sound♪

231
00:15:58,250 --> 00:16:00,200
♪Nothing was ever wrong♪

232
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,250
This porcelain armor

233
00:16:13,833 --> 00:16:15,666
is quite a troublesome thing.

234
00:16:15,700 --> 00:16:17,750
♪I long for impermanence♪

235
00:16:19,025 --> 00:16:21,250
♪The square and circle become poetry♪

236
00:16:22,500 --> 00:16:24,791
Remember to apologize to Le Wei for me.

237
00:16:25,833 --> 00:16:28,125
I was the one who broke the promise.

238
00:16:29,458 --> 00:16:30,333
Senior,

239
00:16:30,333 --> 00:16:32,083
General Le Wei has a message

240
00:16:32,083 --> 00:16:33,375
she asked me to deliver to you.

241
00:16:34,833 --> 00:16:35,708
She said

242
00:16:35,708 --> 00:16:36,750
her agency is called

243
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:38,416
- the Redtail Armed Escort Agency.
- (Our agency)

244
00:16:38,500 --> 00:16:40,041
(is called
the Redtail Armed Escort Agency.)

245
00:16:40,083 --> 00:16:40,833
Red-tail...

246
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:42,583
Means Chi and Wei...

247
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,333
Beautiful. Truly beautiful.

248
00:16:48,458 --> 00:16:49,392
♪Life is the lover of death♪

249
00:16:50,042 --> 00:16:51,283
♪Not its opposite♪

250
00:16:52,042 --> 00:16:52,767
♪If we are steeped♪

251
00:16:53,167 --> 00:16:55,000
♪In the amniotic waters of the world♪

252
00:16:55,708 --> 00:16:56,875
♪Nothing was ever there♪

253
00:16:57,500 --> 00:16:58,750
♪Why should we hold on♪

254
00:16:59,558 --> 00:17:00,283
♪You are far away♪

255
00:17:00,833 --> 00:17:02,342
♪Lightning falls before you♪

256
00:17:03,250 --> 00:17:04,250
♪If the ground is split open♪

257
00:17:04,667 --> 00:17:06,583
(This beautiful battle is over.)

258
00:17:06,583 --> 00:17:09,700
(I have kept our promise.)

259
00:17:10,300 --> 00:17:11,667
♪Nothing was ever there♪

260
00:17:12,342 --> 00:17:13,542
♪Why should we hold on♪

261
00:17:17,958 --> 00:17:19,500
It's our Red Chief,

262
00:17:21,291 --> 00:17:22,083
Chiming.

263
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,958
We'll take you home.

264
00:17:29,167 --> 00:17:31,708
♪I long for impermanence♪

265
00:17:33,125 --> 00:17:33,958
Stop!

266
00:17:36,583 --> 00:17:38,875
♪Life and death, weariness♪

267
00:17:40,458 --> 00:17:42,458
I want them

268
00:17:43,458 --> 00:17:44,583
all

269
00:17:44,583 --> 00:17:45,458
to

270
00:17:45,458 --> 00:17:46,458
die.

271
00:17:47,708 --> 00:17:50,458
♪One stroke, heaven's time♪

272
00:17:51,417 --> 00:17:53,875
♪No one was ever there♪

273
00:17:55,167 --> 00:17:57,750
♪A lifetime has already passed♪

274
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:05,625
Where is Lu Yuanqing?

275
00:18:11,250 --> 00:18:12,375
Why did you come here?

276
00:18:13,791 --> 00:18:15,166
To fulfill a promise.

277
00:18:16,250 --> 00:18:18,000
♪Lightning falls before you♪

278
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:19,833
♪If the ground is split open♪

279
00:18:20,167 --> 00:18:21,833
♪A face is revealed♪

280
00:18:22,250 --> 00:18:23,125
♪The tears she shed♪

281
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:25,417
♪Have drowned our eyes♪

282
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,250
♪Nothing was ever there♪

283
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:29,542
♪Why should we hold on♪

284
00:18:32,541 --> 00:18:34,375
(All the porcelain kilns across
the city form the formation array.)

285
00:18:35,041 --> 00:18:36,750
(There is only one formation core.)

286
00:18:37,375 --> 00:18:38,291
(Destroy the formation core,)

287
00:18:38,583 --> 00:18:40,375
(and every porcelain kiln will explode.)

288
00:18:40,791 --> 00:18:42,625
(The Porcelain Armored Soldiers
will collapse without a fight.)

289
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:02,717
♪Your impermanence♪

290
00:19:06,625 --> 00:19:11,500
♪It is what remains unchanged♪

291
00:19:23,750 --> 00:19:24,750
He did it.

292
00:19:25,875 --> 00:19:27,208
And so did you.

293
00:19:32,333 --> 00:19:33,416
By doing this,

294
00:19:33,416 --> 00:19:34,625
your path to Ascension

295
00:19:34,916 --> 00:19:36,000
ends here.

296
00:19:36,166 --> 00:19:37,916
Even if I truly finish
the Ascension Trial,

297
00:19:38,208 --> 00:19:39,125
what difference would it make?

298
00:19:39,375 --> 00:19:40,666
You set the rules.

299
00:19:41,125 --> 00:19:42,750
You decide the winners and losers.

300
00:19:45,333 --> 00:19:46,583
I told you.

301
00:19:46,958 --> 00:19:48,041
The next time we meet,

302
00:19:48,916 --> 00:19:49,833
watch yourself.

303
00:19:50,166 --> 00:19:51,500
The clash of blades

304
00:19:51,750 --> 00:19:54,250
is merely a contest among mortals.

305
00:19:55,375 --> 00:19:56,250
Lu Yuanqing,

306
00:19:57,250 --> 00:20:00,166
why cling to a mortal body?

307
00:20:01,250 --> 00:20:03,000
Join us

308
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:04,000
and become a god.

309
00:20:04,291 --> 00:20:05,416
Wouldn't that be better?

310
00:20:09,166 --> 00:20:10,333
Master Lu?

311
00:20:11,875 --> 00:20:13,375
What did you do to Master Lu?

312
00:20:14,500 --> 00:20:16,666
Twin Bond.

313
00:20:18,125 --> 00:20:21,000
We can be together forever now.

314
00:20:21,375 --> 00:20:23,817
♪I long for impermanence♪

315
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,175
♪The square and circle become poetry♪

316
00:20:28,667 --> 00:20:31,083
♪Life and death, weariness♪

317
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:34,875
♪Fate comes to rest♪

318
00:20:36,170 --> 00:20:38,958
♪One stroke, barren land♪

319
00:20:39,733 --> 00:20:42,583
♪One stroke, heaven's time♪

320
00:20:43,625 --> 00:20:46,125
♪No one was ever there♪

321
00:20:47,292 --> 00:20:50,042
♪A lifetime has already passed♪
